Compare ways to supply a specified gas to its user (@cs-gas-supply: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @chemical-supply-systems, #source "../sources/Oxygen-Pipeline-and-Piping-Systems-EIGA.lingua#r_7BBE969N5JQJES1KG9AKNBEZBV", #source "../sources/Cryogenic-Liquid-Tanker-Transfers-AIGA.lingua#r_52MNR8Y6S0N1MXDSX8F3XF424C", #source "../sources/Graduate-Logistics-Systems-MIT.lingua#r_4NMCCS7JPNK6CD9V9Z4XTQPKR8", #chemical-supply-systems "../origins/Water-as-a-chemical-feed-utility-and-quality-dependency.lingua#r_4F1V95R9ZFGVVJ3BKZAMQGMBD3") { r_5SM8V9DE71V106BQ9NYPKXPG52
**Read:** [Oxygen Pipeline and Piping Systems — EIGA Doc 13/20](../sources/Oxygen-Pipeline-and-Piping-Systems-EIGA.lingua#r_7BBE969N5JQJES1KG9AKNBEZBV), the full technical publication for the oxygen case; [Good practices guide for loading and unloading of cryogenic liquid tankers — AIGA](../sources/Cryogenic-Liquid-Tanker-Transfers-AIGA.lingua#r_52MNR8Y6S0N1MXDSX8F3XF424C), the entire tanker-transfer guide; [Graduate Logistics Systems — MIT ESD.260J](../sources/Graduate-Logistics-Systems-MIT.lingua#r_4NMCCS7JPNK6CD9V9Z4XTQPKR8), the complete relevant inventory and network teaching.

After the shared air-gas chemistry, compare pipeline supply, bulk cryogenic liquid with vaporisation, packaged compressed gas and production at the user site. Use the same required composition, contaminant panel, flow/pressure range, uptime and operating context. The cheapest nominal gas quantity may not be the cheapest accepted service once storage, reserve, maintenance and analysis are included.

Draw where composition is measured and where the state can change. Include contamination from connections, residual contents, moisture, carrier handling and the receiving system. Separate the producer's release evidence from the quality at the point of use. An inert gas can still create a different facility problem from oxygen; preserve gas-specific technical scope rather than applying one generic compressed-gas rule.

Develop a complete oxygen or nitrogen supply case using the whole relevant association guide. Compare a normal day, a delivery interruption and a maintenance outage. Identify the reserve's usable quantity, the equipment needed to deliver it and the people maintaining readiness. Keep pressure/cryogenic design and hands-on operation in the appropriate professional setting; the documentary case should defend an arrangement and state which observations would be needed to qualify it.

**Continue:** [Distinguish supplied water, solvent, utility and contaminant roles](../origins/Water-as-a-chemical-feed-utility-and-quality-dependency.lingua#r_4F1V95R9ZFGVVJ3BKZAMQGMBD3).

